      "severity": "must",
      "text": "The claim of matching native `renameQuotefix` is false because `SourceText.renameAt` ignores `fixQuote`, leaving the view column name `\"x\" || b` where SQLite produces `'x' || b`. Fix: record stored-text rewriting as incomplete until that function handles `fixQuote` and a regression checks the resulting column name."
